        <mxCell id="queriesbody" value="1. By billing-year label and vehicle type: distinct vehicles, assessed or estimated miles, expected final tax (GBP) and incomplete segments. A gap withholds group miles, group tax and the grand total. Correct the source, extract again and revalidate before release.&#10;&#10;2. Gross additions and refunds: issued tax versus original advance due. These are adjustments, not cash." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontColor=#17324D;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;text;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
